id=servicekit-phone
name=ServiceKit Phone (gadget + HID)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=webagoly-work
description=Rooted USB gadget for ServiceKit Phone: real USB mass-storage stick + HID keyboard. Needs a kernel with configfs USB gadget, f_mass_storage and f_hid. Auto-setup on boot is OFF by default — edit service.sh to enable.
